    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db75a5643e22a81cacbbd3f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于来到了GⅠ竞赛“二月S”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21b3c7aeb5c9625a18e6f34aaffee7bc9b18e90bfffea39b45a966fa5a73dc0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98941d3cecad525ea094533e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到这么多人到场观赛，\n春丽觉得很开心，兴奋不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69882dca07bfb05b1157f224e676542f8ac88ff3031e7a19809490ccd2a5c453",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9683b00cc3f416b1a5abce79",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果是一般的赛马娘，\n面临如此重大的比赛难免会紧张，\n但有着自己步调的春丽仍一如往常。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2c1fa83e5b93e0fa17677654236af5822d90442556ede6101d30847079367c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5a2d780e81f478ca8789631",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她跟训练员约好\n比赛结束后要一起去看“驹～万”，\n走向了赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea8851c7963ea9e35baed6ea496a439ecc4d8730bb12e51eec20ee58855e497b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cf6f6973b0b289d9c3d0186",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向二月S",
      "source_fingerprint": "261313e389ee247b062ee3f8d5f080d8ea9a4a0a46a67874c1cf16eef29490b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ac1d8c5635787954be32d5b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“榆树锦标”当天。\n春丽希望自己能认真地比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "544e9faa425008060a814d02d4f286c0eb231eb297a8523277c371eb4e2915a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b368fe61bcf39ec72baddb3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "场景来到开赛前一刻。\n千里迢迢前来加油的商店街居民们，\n也认真地告诉她“要赢哦”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39d22e95d29a46dc69ec931175040be893dfb5d4553b4bfa1b48d328f7516e13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59cde4a09f5a588532964531",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "收到大家的心意，\n体会到异于兴奋之情的\n春丽──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef13dae913486243e95c5785888ad24650bbf200bd3149d9d28893c8b7b1577",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c6a31b9782bbad39d295c52",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不是为了玩耍，而是为了“获胜”，\n她冲向了赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62a9161718e781a12d31e1f3bf55c8a82be80c0bb8819bbe6cc20b19897cbbcf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:078183205a59c0ee5e0516d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向榆树S",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f62605ebae5ff89c877ac997662ade57e077d22a9be3e36bf43ab34cddd573b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
