    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f38f43e3ea0d08b1c7fcac94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“JBC短途赛”即将开赛前。\n春丽想获胜的决心变得更为坚强，\n忍不住兴奋到坐立难安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bb8ba5d4e7f44c50446aeb06242259ce61a76452e86e5a5b399f2492fba3cf8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bd155e3cf2c4065c0d93994",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了累积实际成果，\n以吸引粉丝的支持──",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbf29f7a2618970c1bc31397ace6fc882f73db9539bd701bab92554bdb0e07f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58abfe3757787222e80b44c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "春丽干劲十足地走向了赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "620851c8d7537f251714c89642b80960bc6faab175d2bba44cfd51223da08420",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e27dbbcd36f1b867bd463973",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向JBC短途赛",
      "source_fingerprint": "47fa7b65c0e423286ccea37f3720e3a26c652ca666d61b3fd06cc17cc845cade",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d19f87ae91cc69ca54d0f92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“有马纪念”当天。春丽感到\n“像水沸腾一样”、“坐立难安”，\n情绪似乎有些混乱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21d65b34c011433204d6c6dd35d51c74b2d7ad45bf5b26506a4df2b307a0b132",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78a369e9700a3f7e14bdfafa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员告诉春丽，\n这就是“认真”。终于理解到“认真”\n是什么感觉的春丽──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b8354d8fc74d565d3ba3fc3bf5592801243451c52e94e7d47b019feeab12996",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4594e6c5d18581f279ceafd8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怀抱着沸腾般的认真想法，\n以“第一名”为目标，\n前往面对比赛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a408dc869cab7b0321b5f1ee8a1e3a373ebd54eeecbf49335a10e88c16f169e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15dc786acefcc423775fa18d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea3f11bf03cefcea1825139c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一次获得第一名的春丽燃起斗志，\n希望接下来也能继续参加许多比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9edda590a585454fc2f6356107c16239e88e9f4473303723863dd4184c42bf1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac1281d03df444e2662b19bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "准备回去时，\n到场支持的商店街众人拉起横幅布条，\n庆祝春丽的出道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3518930a03b2994a7a7d8e0b437f73a19d87663818f44b65f63e4279081a856",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1052/storytimeline_501052415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc568da23e4665a83f0f5316",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对商店街的人们对自己的期待，\n为了回报他们对自己疼爱有加的心意，\n春丽发誓要变得更强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52c45ed13d6a6c97592d3bcc5f73609f0e02fdbd8661842fad346c0bfa04a38e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
